## 4. Auth & profil terpusat

**File:** [`src/shared/auth/contexts/AuthContext.tsx`](src/shared/auth/contexts/AuthContext.tsx)

- `TOKEN_REFRESHED` + user id sama: hanya `setSession`, **bukan** `setUser` ulang (hindari re-render massal).

**File:** [`src/shared/auth/contexts/CentralizedUserDataContext.tsx`](src/shared/auth/contexts/CentralizedUserDataContext.tsx)

- Session lewat ref; jangan kosongkan `organization` saat refresh token.
- Skip fetch ulang untuk user id yang sama (kecuali force refresh / ganti org).

