## 5. Permission config & PageAccessGuard

**File:** [`src/shared/auth/page-access/usePermissionConfiguration.tsx`](src/shared/auth/page-access/usePermissionConfiguration.tsx)

- Ekspor `configBootstrapPending` = `loading && configurations.length === 0`.
- `setLoading(true)` pada fetch hanya bila belum ada baris untuk org (lihat `configurationsRef` / cache).

**File:** [`src/shared/components/PageAccessGuard.tsx`](src/shared/components/PageAccessGuard.tsx)

- `isLoading` guard memakai `configBootstrapPending`, bukan `configLoading` penuh.
- `centralBootstrapPending` = `centralDataLoading && (!centralProfileHydrated || !userData)`.
- Debounce ~250ms untuk denied / loading UI tetap.
- Dengan `loadingShell` + user sudah login: `preserveChildrenOnAccessResolve` (default **true**) → children tetap mounted, skeleton overlay absolut (hindari unmount draft/form).

